      Text = 'Compare saved generations of this selected project. First open Database tools and click Preview retention to find generation IDs and retained caches. Enter the Before ID here; After is the currently displayed generation. Click Compare. Select a result to read its evidence side by side. This compares captured fingerprints and structure; it does not reconstruct historical source text.'
